# rta-resubscribe-interrupted: a replacement dropped during subscribe retries without losing the desired handle
> signin
POST login.live.com/oauth20_connect.srf -> 200
POST login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf grant=device_code -> 200
= ok
> rta-subscribe
POST device.auth.xboxlive.com/device/authenticate signed -> 200
GET title.mgt.xboxlive.com/titles/default/endpoints?type=1 -> 200
POST sisu.xboxlive.com/authorize access=a1 signed -> 200
GET title.mgt.xboxlive.com/titles/current/endpoints auth=x1 signed -> 200
GET rta.xboxlive.com/connect auth=x1 signed -> 101
RTA subscribe https://sessiondirectory.xboxlive.com/connections/ -> connection=1
= ok
> rta-drop
GET rta.xboxlive.com/connect auth=x1 signed -> 101
RTA subscribe https://sessiondirectory.xboxlive.com/connections/ -> reset
GET rta.xboxlive.com/connect auth=x1 signed -> 101
RTA subscribe https://sessiondirectory.xboxlive.com/connections/ -> connection=3
= ok
